+        $$
+        \begin{aligned}
+        UV_{min} &= \left( \frac{u}{N}, \frac{v}{N} \right) \\
+        UV_{max} &= \left( \frac{u+1}{N}, \frac{v+1}{N} \right)
+        \end{aligned}
